  "solution": "1. + and -\n\n__**210 ÷ 7**__ × 320 ÷ (16 + __**4 × 15 × 17**__) = __**15 - 5**__\n\n⇒ 30 × 320 ÷ __**(16 +**____** 1020)**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 30 × __**320 ÷ 1036**__ = 10\n\n⇒ __**30 × 0.30**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 9 ≠ 10\n\n2. × and -\n\n__**210 ÷ 7**__ - 320 ÷ (__**16 × 4**__ - 15 - 17) = __**15 + 5**__\n\n⇒ 30 - 320 ÷ (64 __**-**____** 15 -**____** 17**__) = 20\n\n⇒ 30 - 320 ÷ __**(6**____**4 - 32**____**)**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 30 - __**320 ÷ 32**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**30**____** - 10**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\n3. × and +\n\n__**210 ÷ 7**__ + 320 ÷ (__**16**__ - 4 __**+ 15 + 17**__) = __**15 + 5**__\n\n⇒ 30 + 320 ÷ __**(48 - 4)**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 30 + __**320 ÷ 44**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**30 + 7.27**____** **__= 20\n\n⇒ 37.27 ≠ 20\n\n4. ÷ and +\n\n⇒ 210 + __**7 × 320**__ + (16 - __**4 × 15 × 17**__) = __**15 ÷ 5**__\n\n⇒ 210 + 2240 + __**(16 - 1020)**__ = 3\n\n⇒ __**210 + 2240**__ - 1004 = 3\n\n⇒ 2450 - 1004 = 3\n\n⇒ 1446 ≠ 3\n\nHence, '**× and -**' is the correct answer.",
